# Shortcuts:
# Cmd/Ctrl+Enter - Toggle todo box
# Alt+D - Mark as done (✔)
# Alt+C - Mark as cancelled (✘)
# Alt+S - Toggle start (enables timer)
# Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+A - Archive completed todos

